      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Fry the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "Heat oil in a large frying pan over medium-high. Season and fry the diced chicken for 8–10 minutes until golden and cooked through."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
