        "alt": "Cook the noodles and beans",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "step-4",
      "heading": "Make the sambal sauce",
      "blocks": [
        "Fry the garlic and ginger purée with the cooked chicken for 1 minute. Stir in the ketjap manis, soy sauce, sambal, honey and {{sauce-water}} water. Simmer for 3–4 minutes until thickened."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
